  <mj-section padding="16px 32px 24px">
    <mj-column>
      <mj-text font-size="16px" font-weight="700" color="#002771" line-height="1.3" padding="0">See what Claude can build once it's connected</mj-text>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
  <mj-section padding="0 32px 16px">
    <mj-column>
      <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#61667C" line-height="1.6" padding="0">Ask Claude to analyze your sales, channel, and product data, and it can turn the answer into a shareable Claude Artifact - a dashboard like this one, built entirely from live data pulled through the MCP connection.</mj-text>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
